<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee weaker on dollar, firms on pound.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee weaker on dollar, firms on pound.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee weakened against the dollar but firmed against the pound on Friday, forex dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee was fixed at a mean commercial rate of 20.1535 against the dollar from 20.1315 on Thursday. Against the pound, the rupee was quoted at a mean of 32.6775 for one pound from 32.9460 on Thursday.</p>
